#. column 0: fabled belt of aiming
#. column 2: fabled belts of aiming
#. column 8: Before becoming obsolete due to advancements in tailoring, belts such as this were used for holding up trousers and the like.
msgctxt "Item:11847:0:9"
msgid "Fabled Belt of Aiming"
msgstr "Сказочный пояс меткости"

